\tPayment\tAmount\nKiosk Dashboard\n\nManage your customer kiosks for UI Audit Restaurant A.\n\nActivated kiosks\n0\nOnline kiosks\n0\nAvailable menu items\n100\nGet your kiosks ready\n1. Set up your menu\n\nChoose a restaurant template or add your own dishes.\n\n2. Design the customer screen\n\nSet your logo, welcome screen and wording.\n\n3. Check payments\n\nReview collection, fees and settlement details.\n\n4. Connect your kiosks\n\nActivate the customer terminal with its own kiosk key.\n\nCollection and restaurant payouts\n\nCustomer collection is separate from money paid to your restaurant.\n\nGross Collection\n\n₹0.00\n\nJamanvaar Fee\n\n₹0.00\n\nNet Payable\n\n₹0.00\n\nPending Payout\n\n₹0.00\nOpen Payments & Payouts\nGuest menu readiness\nCheck again\n\nMenu version 1 is published.\n\nDraft: 100 dishes in 10 categories.\n\n1. Publish your menu. Resolve the errors above, then publish the latest draft.\n2. Confirm terminal delivery. 1 of 1 devices report the current menu. Check device acknowledgements\n3. Open a guest menu. Set up a table QR\n4. Verify staff receive an order. Use a supervised test in your configured test environment. Confirm the correct counter and kitchen receive it. This checklist does not place or pay for an order.\nOpen menu & publish\n\nPublication confirms the server menu. Check a guest QR page or kiosk and place a test order to verify delivery to staff.\n\nBefore your first guest\nYour branch setup checklist\nCheck setup again\n\nA setup check verifies configuration. Place a small test order and confirm staff receive it before opening service.\n\nSelected branch · 7/9 checks passed · Finish the checks below\n\nActive, correctly mapped QR codes\n\nGenerate a QR code for a valid table or menu in Tables & QR.\n\nOpen settings →\nOnline payment readinessOptional\n\nConfigure your merchant integration or turn off online payment.\n\nOpen settings →\nView completed checks (7)\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nLocal Engine Active\nOFFLINE-FIRST INDIAN RESTAURANT SYSTEM\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nYOUR RESTAURANT WORKSPACE\n\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nDatabase Initialized\n•\nLocal-First Mode",
